1
00:00:00,011 --> 00:00:02,311
(Stuart:)Was it ever a dress-up party?

2
00:00:02,313 --> 00:00:04,713
(Sheldon:)No.

3
00:00:04,715 --> 00:00:07,955
(Stuart:)Howard, didn't you tell me
it was a dress-up party?

4
00:00:07,952 --> 00:00:10,482
Yeah. (chuckles)

5
00:00:13,024 --> 00:00:15,124
(knocking on door)

6
00:00:20,297 --> 00:00:23,997
(Stuart:)I was told this is where to go
if I'm mad at Howard.

7
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:29,570
(Penny:)May I take your cloak?

8
00:00:29,573 --> 00:00:31,203
(Stuart:)Thanks.

9
00:00:31,208 --> 00:00:35,048
(Stuart:)This thing kept getting caught
in the chain of my bike.

10
00:00:35,046 --> 00:00:37,376
(Sheldon:)Well, I'll catch you up.

11
00:00:37,381 --> 00:00:40,381
(Sheldon:)Uh, Penny is angry at Leonard,
Leonard's angry at me and Penny,

12
00:00:40,384 --> 00:00:42,054
(Sheldon:)I'm angry at Leonard and Amy,

13
00:00:42,053 --> 00:00:43,623
(Sheldon:)Raj is angry at Howard,

14
00:00:43,621 --> 00:00:45,821
(Sheldon:)and I'm angry
at George R.R. Martin

15
00:00:45,823 --> 00:00:48,623
(Sheldon:)'cause there are no new books
for me to spoil for Leonard.

16
00:00:48,626 --> 00:00:52,396
(Stuart:)So what happened
with you and Howard?

17
00:00:52,396 --> 00:00:53,896
(Raj:)Says I was talking too much

18
00:00:53,898 --> 00:00:55,228
(Raj:)about dating Claire and Emily,

19
00:00:55,232 --> 00:00:57,662
(Raj:)and I accused him
of being jealous.

